# SSO-3113 — provisioning receipts (`thoryn provision apply` writes <name>.receipt.json next to the file;
# secret-free, but per-account state like Terraform state) and `--secret-file` output (a one-time client
# secret must never reach a commit).
.thoryn/*.receipt.json
*.secret
__pycache__/
